{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-12-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'FIRST REPUBLIC BANK DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON TWO SERIES OF PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK FOR FOURTH QUARTER 2022', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS DECLARED CASH DIVIDENDS ON THE FOLLOWING OUTSTANDING SERIES OF ITS PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK.'}